773	/**
774	 * Best-effort Minecraft RCON push. Reads rcon config from the (updated)
775	 * server.properties; if RCON is enabled, a password is set, and `mcrcon` exists
776	 * on the box, pushes the live-editable settings. Anything missing → note a restart.
